{
  "id": "GEN.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Obuchachilo 29",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yakholela Labani khulzua Raheli naLea, mbu abateeshie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yakobo natsiililila khuluchendolwe, niyoola khushibala shiabandu bebukwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahenga, ne lola, liyabo liamatsi ndielo mumukunda, ne amakondi amatuuli kataru ngako, nikakonileho ahambi ninalio; okhuba mwiyabo omwo nimwo omwa banyweesinjia ebiayo; nelichina eliali khumunwa kweliyabo liali likhongo muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amatuuli kosi kali nikakhung'aasi; libungwaho; mana bali nibaselenjesinjia lichina barusie khumunwa kweliyabo, nibanyweesia amakondi, nibakalusia lichina khumunwa kweliyabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo nabareeba mbu Abashianje, murulile heena? Nibakalusia bari Khuli abeHarani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabareeba mbu Mumanyile Labani omwana waNahori? Nabo bari Khumumanyile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabareeba ari Nomulamu noho? Nabo bari Nomulamu; khandi lola, omukhaanawe Raheli ngwoyo, yeetsanga nende amakondi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nababoolela mbu Lole, shishili eshiteere, shineshise eshia emiruko okhukhung'aasilibwakhwo tawe; munyweesie amakondi, mutsie mwaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibaboola bari Shikhunyala ta, okhuula amatuuli kosi olwa kaba nikakhung'aasiibwe halala, nibaselenjesia lichina lirule khumunwa kweliyabo, mana khulanyweesia amakondi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa yali nashiboolananga ninabo, Raheli niyeetsa nende amakondi kasamwana; okhuba niye owalinji omwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olwa Yakobo yalola Raheli omukhaana waLabani khootsanyene, nende amakondi kaLabani khootsanyene Yakobo yasita ahambi naselenjesia lichina nalirusia khumunwa kweliyabo, nanyweesia ebiayo biaLabani khootsanyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yakobo namutsunzuuna Raheli, nachinga omwoyo nalila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo naboolela Raheli shinga olwa ali omwihwa wasamwana, khandi mbu nomwana waRebeka; naye niyeelukha natsia naboolela samwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Labani yahulila amakhuwa kaYakobo omwihwawe, yeelukha okhumubukaanila, namukwakhwo namufumbeelela, namutsunzuuna, namuleera munzuye. Naye naboolela Labani amakhuwa ako kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani namuboolela mbu Toto oli likumba eliokhumubili kwanje, khandi inyama eyokhumubili kwaulje. Namenyayo ninaye eshise shiomwesi mulala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Labani yareeba Yakobo ari Okhoyile okhu'kholela butswa shichila oli omwihwa wanje, noho? Khamboolele omurungokwo okwa ekhuhe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Labani yali nende abaanabe abakhaana babili; eliira liowambeli niye Lea, neliira liomushe niye Raheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne tsimoni tsiaLea tsiali tsindeshele; habula Raheli yakaasa muno omubilikwe kwosi nomumoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo naye yaheela Raheli; nasunga mbu Ndalakhukholela emiyika musaafu khulwa Raheli omukhaanawo omushe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani naboola ari Nobulayi nikhuheele iwe; khushila okhuheelesia omundu undi; menyakhwo ninasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yakobo yakhola emiyika musaafu khulwa Raheli; nichiba khuye shinga tsindaalo tsinduutu butswa, khulwa obuheeli obwa yali niyamuheela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yakobo namusunjila Labani mbu Umbeelesie omukhasi wanje, okhuba tsindaalo tsianje tsihweele, mbu emuteeshie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Labani nakhung'aasia halala abandu bosi bahabwene yaho, nateekha lisabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mungoloobe yabukula Lea omwanawe omukhaana, namuyilila Yakobo; naye namuteeshia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iihandi Labani naheelesia omwanawe Lea omukholiwe omukhaana Zilipa, mbu abe omukholiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikaba mbu mukamba, khane yali Lea; Yakobo nareeba Labani ari Lino nelikhuwa shiina elia ukholeele? Shindakhukholela khulwa Raheli? Kho nishiina eshichila niungaatiye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani nasunga mbu Shikeekholanga kario mushialo shieefwe ta, okhubakha omushe nomukhulundu nashili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala lihonga lia uno, mana khulakhuheelesia nende oundi oyo khandi khulwa obukholi obwa witsa okhukholela emiyika chindi musaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yakobo nakhola ario, namala lihongalie; mana Labani namubashila Raheli omwanawe abe omukhasiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani naheelesia omwanawe Raheli omukholiwe omukhaana Biliha, abe omukholiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo nateeshia Raheli, naheela Raheli okhushila Lea; namukholela emiyika chindi musaafu khandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaana aba Yakobo yeebula",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
